# Self-improvement loop

Durable memory lives in `.cursor/lessons.md` (workspace-shared, not per-repo).
Session checklists use the native todo list, not a markdown todo file.

## At session start

- Skim `.cursor/lessons.md` for patterns relevant to this project or task.
- Apply matching lessons without waiting to be reminded.

## After any user correction

- Append the pattern to `.cursor/lessons.md` immediately.
- Do not add a `.cursor/rules` file for operational how-to knowledge. Rules are essential constraints only (safety, never-do, always-apply workflow).
- Iterate until that class of mistake stops repeating.
